# Wave T44 (Honeyfield kit): beehive — a straw skep hive, seated beside the town's honey trees (the honey-trees sign's beat made visible). Coiled straw bands, a dark entry notch, two bee dots at the entry. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in (measured #2a8320, tg-floaroma's rendered flat). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T44-HONEYFIELD-PLAN.md §5.)
